*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Anko Inkless A4 Printer (Kmart 43618996) / MV-B530 and clones.
*% Pairs with the rastertomvb530 filter and the mvb530 backend.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "2.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "MVB530.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Anko"
*Product: "(Inkless A4 Printer)"
*ModelName: "Anko Inkless A4 MV-B530"
*ShortNickName: "Anko Inkless A4"
*NickName: "Anko Inkless A4 (MV-B530)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42

*% cupsd rasterises the job and hands it to our filter.
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 rastertomvb530"

*% The imageable area is exactly 8 inches wide, so at 200 dpi cupsWidth comes
*% out at the printer's native 1600 dots and no rescaling is needed.
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "10 0 586 842"
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 200dpi
*Resolution 200dpi/200 dpi: "<</HWResolution[200 200]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% Eight-bit greyscale in, so the filter can dither rather than take whatever
*% one-bit output the rasteriser would have produced.
*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Greyscale: "<</cupsColorSpace 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *Darkness/Darkness: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *Darkness
*DefaultDarkness: 3
*Darkness 1/1 - Lightest: ""
*Darkness 2/2: ""
*Darkness 3/3 - Normal: ""
*Darkness 4/4: ""
*Darkness 5/5 - Darkest: ""
*CloseUI: *Darkness

*OpenUI *MvbDither/Halftone: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 50 AnySetup *MvbDither
*DefaultMvbDither: Atkinson
*MvbDither Atkinson/Atkinson dither - photos: ""
*MvbDither None/Threshold - text and line art: ""
*CloseUI: *MvbDither

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
*% End of PPD
